x text-14px text-white/90 font-500 leading-normal hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-200" style="aspect-ratio:82 / 128;width:82px" href="/full-episodes/bound-by-love-69d91b3ee15105112e0dc022"><h4 class="max-w-full text-center">All Episodes</h4><span class="h-24px w-24px flex-center"><span role="img" class="anticon text-14px text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M12.454 6.96a.562.562 0 0 0 0-.796l-6-6A.562.562 0 0 0 5.66.96L10.66 5.96H.602a.602.602 0 0 0 0 1.203H10.66l-5 5.002a.562.562 0 1 0 .794.794z"></path></svg></span></span></a></div></section><div class="mt-8/vw md:mt-0"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 text-12/vw md:mb-16px mb-16/vw md:text-20px text-20/vw md:font-700 text-white/80 ">Plot of Bound by Love</h3><div class="md:rounded-16px md:bg-[#141414] md:px-24px md:py-24px"><div class="relative min-w-0 w-full leading-[normal] text-12/vw md:text-14px rich-text break-words text-white/50 text-14/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px md:leading-19px"><div data-collapsible-text-container="true" style="overflow:hidden" class="relative"><div data-collapsible-text-content="true"><div data-collapsible-text-content-body="true"><div>Drama also known as His Cure His Wife; Aria won Luca’s love in an arranged mafia marriage, but when she secretly helps her sister flee the life, she betrays him. With their families at war and a baby on the way, Aria must decide whether love can survive when loyalty is paid for in blood.</div></div></div></div><div data-collapsible-text-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full"><div>Drama also known as His Cure His Wife; Aria won Luca’s love in an arranged mafia marriage, but when she secretly helps her sister flee the life, she betrays him. With their families at war and a baby on the way, Aria must decide whether love can survive when loyalty is paid for in blood.</div></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><span style="float:right;width:0"></span><div style="float:right;clear:both" class="flex items-center"><span class="lead cursor-pointer text-white/90 text-14/vw md:text-14px">More</span></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-candidate="true"></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute block">M</span></div></div></div><div class=""><h3 class="mb-12/vw text-16/vw md:mb-12px md:text-20px text-white/90 md:text-white/80 font-700">You Might Like</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-[1.333333vw] gap-y-[3.2vw] md:grid-cols-6 md:gap-x-24px md:gap-y-24px"></div></div><section class="" id="faq"><h3 class="break-words text-20px text-white/80 font-700 leading-normal">Bound by Love FAQs</h3><div class="mt-12/vw flex flex-col gap-16/vw rounded-8/vw bg-[#141414] px-16/vw py-24/vw md:mt-16px md:gap-24px md:rounded-16px md:p-32px"><div><h4><button type="button" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-16/vw bg-transparent text-left text-14/vw text-white/80 focus-visible:outline-none md:gap-24px md:text-16px" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-episode-count"><span class="flex-1 break-words leading-normal">1<!-- -->. <!-- -->How many episodes does Bound by Love have?</span><span class="flex h-16/vw w-16/vw shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:h-20px md:w-20px"><span role="img" class="anticon block text-16/vw text-white/80 md:text-20px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 2v8m0 8v-8m0 0h8m-8 0H2"></path></svg></span></span></button></h4><div class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,margin] duration-200 ease-out mt-0 grid-ro