g-[normal] text-12/vw md:text-14px rich-text break-words text-white/50 text-14/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px md:leading-19px"><div data-collapsible-text-container="true" style="overflow:hidden" class="relative"><div data-collapsible-text-content="true"><div data-collapsible-text-content-body="true"><div>Drama also known as His Cure His Wife; Aria won Luca’s love in an arranged mafia marriage, but when she secretly helps her sister flee the life, she betrays him. With their families at war and a baby on the way, Aria must decide whether love can survive when loyalty is paid for in blood.</div></div></div></div><div data-collapsible-text-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full"><div>Drama also known as His Cure His Wife; Aria won Luca’s love in an arranged mafia marriage, but when she secretly helps her sister flee the life, she betrays him. With their families at war and a baby on the way, Aria must decide whether love can survive when loyalty is paid for in blood.</div></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><span style="float:right;width:0"></span><div style="float:right;clear:both" class="flex items-center"><span class="lead cursor-pointer text-white/90 text-14/vw md:text-14px">More</span></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-candidate="true"></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute block">M</span></div></div></div><div class="h-1/vw bg-white/10 my-24/vw"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-40/vw pb-80/vw"><div role="tabs" class="md:hidden"><div role="tab-nav-list" class="mb-8/vw h-17/vw flex items-center justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-md p-0 md:mb-6px md:mt-12px md:h-40px"><div class="flex shrink-1"></div><a class="flex items-center rounded-4/vw text-14/vw text-white/50 leading-[1.2] md:text-14px md:text-white md:leading-normal" href="